msgid "Factor loadings"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Factor loadings of the indicators on their factors. Each loading reflects "
"how strongly an indicator is related to its factor. With marker variable "
"identification, the loading of the first indicator of each factor is fixed "
"to 1."
msgstr ""

